.TH PYHANKO 1 "November 2026" "pyHanko 0.25.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pyhanko \- tools for stamping and signing PDF files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pyhanko
.RI [ options ] " command"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pyhanko
reads and writes PDF files with PAdES digital signatures, including invisible
and visible signatures, encryption and signature validation.
.SH COMMANDS
A summary of the available commands follows.
.TP
.B sign
create signatures with different backends.
.TP
.B validate
validate signatures in PDF files.
.TP
.B stamp
apply QR codes and stamps.
.TP
.B crypt
manage the encryption of PDF files.
.TP
.B fields
inspect the form fields of PDF files.
.SH OPTIONS
Every command accepts the
.B \-\-help
option, which documents its own options.
.SH SEE ALSO
The full documentation is at
.UR https://pyhanko.readthedocs.io/
.UE
